  "description": "<p data-start=\"96\" data-end=\"519\">Te koop aangeboden: <em data-start=\"136\" data-end=\"169\">Crash Bandicoot N. Sane Trilogy</em> voor de PlayStation 4.<br data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"195\">Beleef de klassieke avonturen van Crash opnieuw in volledig geremasterde graphics. Deze bundel bevat de drie originele Crash Bandicoot games: <strong data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"356\">Crash Bandicoot</strong>, <strong data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"400\">Crash Bandicoot 2: Cortex Strikes Back</strong> en <strong data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"433\">Crash Bandicoot 3: Warped</strong>. Spring, ren en spin door uitdagende levels vol obstakels, vijanden en geheime paden.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"595\">Perfect voor zowel nostalgische spelers als nieuwe fans van platformgames.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"612\"><strong data-start=\"597\" data-end=\"612\">✅ Kenmerken</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<li data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"641\">\r\n<p data-start=\"616\" data-end=\"641\">Platform: PlayStation 4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"672\">Genre: Platform / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"705\">\r\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"705\">Aantal spelers: Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"717\">\r\n<p data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"717\">PEGI: 7</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"718\" data-end=\"802\">\r\n<p data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"802\">Taal: Engels (game), vaak ook NL menu/ondertiteling afhankelijk van instellingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"825\"><strong data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"825\">📦 Staat & inhoud</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"849\">Staat: Goede staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"850\" data-end=\"868\">\r\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"86